    "warning": "**Real data, different businesses.** Annual accounts of Polish manufacturing companies (2000\u20132013) and whether they went bankrupt within a year. FINEXT computes the same ratios from an MSME's books, but Cambodian MSMEs are smaller and differently financed: describe output as *likely deterioration*, never as a prediction of loan default.",
    "data": [
