      "Attribute meanings checked against ratios built from the same figures: assets/liabilities = 1/(liabilities/assets) 99.98%, working capital/assets = (current ratio - 1) \u00d7 short-term bills/assets 99.98%, sales/receivables = 365/receivable days 99.98%, sales/inventory = 365/inventory days 99.98%.",
      "**Target** `bankrupt_next_year`: 408 bankrupt within a year (7.0%).",
      "23 of the 64 ratios are used: those FINEXT can also compute from a shop's books."
